  evidence: $E/t6/upstream/results.json and $E/t6/upstream/*.log
  depends-on: none
  falsifier: A raw log lacks collected tests while this check succeeds, or the checked revision differs.

SG-2 Prove upstream compatibility against the live shim
  done-when: After SG-1, all four suites have exit_code=0 and failures=0, and their captured requests identify the deployed shim; `jq -e 'all(.suites[]; .tests_executed>0 and .exit_code==0 and .failures==0)' "$E/t6/upstream/results.json"` succeeds.
