  done-when: Send a unique nonce to the registered Consensus agent, lease it, and read back the same message ID and bytes from crier; `jq -e --arg n "$NONCE" '.delivered.id==.leased.id and .leased.payload==$n and .leased.lease_id!=""' "$E/t7/delivery.json"` succeeds.
