SG-4 Prove Consensus consumed only its crier message
  done-when: Match SG-3’s message ID and nonce to one crier-origin `user_message`, a later agent-visible context/reply, and an ack; also deliver a second nonce to another agent and prove zero Consensus rows for it. Check the cross-store IDs/counts from `$E/t7/intake.json` with `jq -e '.positive.ledger_count==1 and .positive.reply_count>=1 and .positive.acked==true and .negative.ledger_count==0' "$E/t7/intake.json"`; verify the JSON values against the DB and crier readbacks.
